       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SQTSYSGN.
       AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPTEMBER l987.
      *INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *REMARKS.
      *D CREATE A SYSTEM GENERATED QUOTE
      ******************************************************************
      ******************************************************************
      *                      S Q T S Y S G N                           *
      *   THIS SCREEN PROGRAM WILL VALIDATE ENTERED DATA AND THEN      *
      * CREATE A QUOTE FROM A PURCHASE ORDER, ANOTHER QUOTE, OR A      *
      * REQUISITION BY KICKING OFF A JOBSTREAM TO DO THE ACTUAL        *
      * CREATION.  UP TO 5 VENDORS MAY BE ENTERED.                     *
      * A NEW QUOTE MAY BE CREATED IN THE OLD DOCUMENT ORDER AND IN    *
      * SORTED CODE ORDER. (REQUISITIONS OF COURSE HAVE ONLY ONE CODE) *
      ******************************************************************
      *C     6/04/94  MARVIN MITCHELL REQUEST #94-017
      *C     ADDED TWO MORE PRINTER OPTIONS FOR PRINTING QUOTES,
      *C     AND LOGIC THAT CHECKS FOR A VALID SELECTION.
      *C
      *C     8/08/94  MARVIN MITCHELL
      *C     CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF COPYMMIS AND COPYCSIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C
      *C     5/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C     8/13/96  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #96-009
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW USER TO REQUEST A SYSTEM-GENERATED
      *C     QUOTE BY COMBINATION OF MANUFACTURER AND KEYWORD MODIFIER.
      *C
      *C     8/14/96  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     MADE REVISIONS FOR END OF CENTURY COMPATABILITY.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCQUOT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT DVENDOR-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDITM3-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0803
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDITM5-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0805
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MSTORERM-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DQUOTEXT-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DQUOTEXT-O
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MBUYER-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0601
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DREQITM-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2201
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MPORCV-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DMANPART-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3601
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DCODE-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3401
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT MMANUFACT-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3501
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
